        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2050 European Mortise Deadbolt with Integrated Roller Latch </b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nTailored to suit the needs of large, modern-style entry and pivot doors, the European Mortise Deadbolt combines a locking mortise deadbolt with an integrated roller latch for enhanced security and ease of use. Available in a round or square deadbolt option to coordinate with Emtek's Long Door Pull options, the European Mortise Deadbolt can used in conjunction with the Heavy Duty Roller Latch for additional ease of use on oversized doors.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> The deadbolt thrown or retracted from interior by thumbturn and from exterior by key. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the European Mortise Deadbolt with Integrated Roller Latch:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Package includes: deadbolt mechanism with integrated roller latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li>2 Keys</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>For interior or exterior applications</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the European Mortise Deadbolt with Integrated Roller Latch:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Faceplate Length: 9-15/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim: 2-1/4\" Square</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Trim: 2-1/4\" Square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
